# Normalise line endings.
#
# Without this, a Windows checkout rewrites every file to CRLF and `git status`
# reports the entire tree as modified — which buries the handful of files that
# genuinely differ from upstream. Since this fork carries deliberate core
# patches that must be reviewed after every merge, that noise is not survivable.
#
# After adding this file, renormalise once:
#
#   git add --renormalize .
#   git commit -m "chore: normalise line endings"
#
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary files git should never touch.
*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.jpeg  binary
*.gif   binary
*.ico   binary
*.woff  binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf   binary
*.eot   binary
*.pdf   binary
*.zip   binary
*.gz    binary
